`lstat()` reports on the link itself; `stat()` follows the link.
```c
struct stat sb;
stat(argv[1], &sb);
if (S_ISDIR(sb.st_mode))
printf("directory\n");
else if (S_ISREG(sb.st_mode))
printf("regular\n");
else
printf("other\n");
```

